cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Conservation diagnostics for deep learning groundwater surrogates"
abstract: >-
  Companion code for a diagnostic framework that evaluates deep-learning
  groundwater surrogates on governing-equation residuals, boundary-condition
  compliance, boundary-gradient direction and mass-balance closure alongside
  predictive accuracy, applied to CNN, ConvLSTM and physics-informed surrogates
  on two MODFLOW benchmarks.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/mikedidem/gw_surrogate_evaluation"
